### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Get all products — filter by name
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=keyboard

### Get all products — sort by price
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=price

### Get all products — filter + sort together
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=m&sort=price

### Get a single product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### Get a product that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/999

### Add a new product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Hub",
  "price": 1290,
  "quantity": 8
}

### Add a product with defaults (quantity defaults to 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mousepad XL",
  "price": 450
}

### Add a product — missing required field (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Price Product"
}

### Add a product — invalid price (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Product",
  "price": "not-a-number"
}

### Update a product (PUT — replaces all fields)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "price": 3299,
  "quantity": 3
}

### Update a product that doesn't exist (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Product",
  "price": 100,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2

### Delete a product that doesn't exist (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/999

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/
